  "//": "THE SNAKE (docs/PLAN_weapon_coats.md package D). A legless body of twelve segments laid straight along +Z, posed by the `slither` block (Mob::ApplySlither, game/pose.cpp) and laid on the ground by its always-on prone state. The .vox and every limb's `anchor` and the jaws' `edge` are WRITTEN by `node scripts/gen_snake.mjs`; edit the table there, not the numbers here. DESIGN.md 'The snake'.",
  "root": "body5",
  "artVoxelsPerMetre": 80,
  "bleed": {
    "material": "blood",
    "perDamage": 2
  },
  "sounds": {
    "dismember": "dismember",
    "bleed": "bleed"
  },
  "//anatomy": "Skin, a flesh layer, a muscle layer and a bone core: in a body this thin the core IS the spine. The head is a thin skull over jaw muscle, with a brain at the back and the VENOM GLANDS either side of it. The glands are painted as the STAND-IN `flesh_cooked` (limbs.head.carve[0]) because a .vox can only paint material ids up to 127 and `venom_gland` sits above that; `becomes` rewrites every stand-in voxel to the gland at load (mob.cpp, after the recipe resolves, beside garmentsBecome). `venom_gland` is that ONE string. A build whose materials.json lacks it logs a line and keeps the stand-in. Re-bake with `node scripts/gen_snake.mjs`.",
  "anatomy": {
    "layers": [
      {
        "material": "skin",
        "depth": 1,
        "keep": true
      },
      {
        "material": "flesh",
        "depth": 1
      },
      {
        "material": "muscle",
        "depth": 1,
        "speckle": {
          "material": "blood",
          "fraction": 0.05
        }
      },
      {
        "material": "bone"
      }
    ],
    "limbs": {
      "head": {
        "layers": [
          {
            "material": "skin",
            "depth": 1,
            "keep": true
          },
          {
            "material": "flesh",
            "depth": 1
          },
          {
            "material": "bone",
            "depth": 1
          },
          {
            "material": "muscle"
          }
        ],
        "carve": [
          {
            "material": "flesh_cooked",
            "where": "muscle",
            "box": {
              "z": [
                0.1,
                0.8
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "material": "brain",
            "where": "muscle",
            "box": {
              "x": [
